--- !u!114 &988823424
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 988823422}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: In this demo, you will experience a first impression of PICO's more advanced
      features
    Object: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c80ceb51b3238194fa0c7b9ca578f510, type: 2}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "En esta demo experimentar\xE1s una primera impresi\xF3n de las funciones
      m\xE1s avanzadas de PICO"
    Object: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c80ceb51b3238194fa0c7b9ca578f510, type: 2}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Dans cette d\xE9mo, vous aurez une premi\xE8re impression des fonctionnalit\xE9s
      les plus avanc\xE9es de PICO."
    Object: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c80ceb51b3238194fa0c7b9ca578f510, type: 2}
  - Language: German
    Text: In dieser Demo erhalten Sie einen ersten Eindruck von den erweiterten Funktionen
      von PICO
    Object: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c80ceb51b3238194fa0c7b9ca578f510, type: 2}
  - Language: Chinese
    Text: "\u5728\u8FD9\u4E2A\u6F14\u793A\u4E2D\uFF0C\u4F60\u5C06\u4F53\u9A8C\u5230PICO\u66F4\u9AD8\u7EA7\u529F\u80FD\u7684\u7B2C\u4E00\u5370\u8C61"
    Object: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4089bd732b9b5a4fab44cc1643038ff, type: 2}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uC774 \uB370\uBAA8\uC5D0\uC11C\uB294 PICO\uC758 \uACE0\uAE09 \uAE30\uB2A5\uC5D0
      \uB300\uD55C \uCCAB\uC778\uC0C1\uC744 \uACBD\uD5D8\uD574 \uBCF4\uC2E4 \uC218
      \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 77a199d47fc2c6b41b230a391b65941a, type: 2}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u3053\u306E\u30C7\u30E2\u3067\u306F\u3001PICO\u306E\u3088\u308A\u9AD8\u5EA6\u306A\u6A5F\u80FD\u306E\u30D5\u30A1\u30FC\u30B9\u30C8\u30A4\u30F3\u30D7\u30EC\u30C3\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u4F53\u9A13\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3059"
    Object: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3e08cf13c8d9124e9c791dc631c31f0, type: 2}
